actual_result: "334focused tests and complete typecheck pass. Reviewed SDK snapshot explicitly acknowledges the optional read field. Build, static contract checks, tracker/graph/history integrity and mutation controls pass. Existing local latency limitation is recorded under pm-bj7rq0 and remains subject to required hosted acceptance."
