  "2026-10-17T12:56:15.476Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live keyword search and open/in_progress inventory found no active review closeout. Reuse pm-ul0ow4 delivery parent and related pm-gh1482, pm-gh1486, pm-7zs0; all prior implementation items remain closed. Review anchors 4302702409,4302702413,4302702419,4302702423 on head3622a20."
  "2026-10-17T12:56:34.932Z","harness:codex","Review analysis: strict timestamp check is valid; mutable reminder schedule summary is stale and has been updated through PM. GetResult already exposes Partial<Dependency>, but full list and core read types require further inspection before dismissing the read-type finding. Renderer exclusion must target the health verdict payload only."
  "2026-10-17T12:58:25.190Z","harness:codex","Read-type finding confirmed beyond GetResult: raw full list rows and lower-level ItemMetadata dependency reads expose Dependency.created_at as required, although legacy records omit it. Marking that provenance optional matches supported stored data. Create/update seed contracts already allow omission and synthesize real current provenance for new edges, so no required write-input field is removed. Added negative compile-time use checks for Dependency, ListedItem and GetResult."
  "2026-10-17T13:17:36.704Z","harness:codex","Review verification: 334 focused tests across5files and all four typecheck projects pass. Strict timestamp regressions cover informal dates and invalid calendar dates. SDK negative compile-time controls require provenance narrowing for Dependency, ListedItem and GetResult. Validation adaptive encoding round-trips heterogeneous details while health retains structured checks via its verdict marker. Initial uniform nested test fixture was naturally encoded by TOON4.4 and was corrected to heterogeneous validation reports. Build, docstrings, tracker quality, graph, record integrity, registry, SDK snapshot, entrypoint costs and348mutation controls pass (341killed/7equivalent/0survivors). Local qualified context latency434ms/433ms remains under pm-bj7rq0; hosted static acceptance is pending. Three missing planning fields on this review task were completed, and exact tracker-quality rerun passes."
